{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34471","headline":"中元夜寄道侣二首 一 · 陆龟蒙","name":"中元夜寄道侣二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"学饵霜茸骨未轻，每逢真夕梦还清。\n丁宁独受金妃约，许与亲题玉篆名。\n月苦撼残临水佩，风微飘断系云缨。\n须臾枕上桐窗晓，露压千枝滴滴声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34471.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34471","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}